@q 4:8-9

India is a top mobile-gaming market by downloads but not second by revenue, so the Assertion is false; it has over **950 million** internet users. **mjunction** (Tata Steel-SAIL) was once India's largest **B2B** e-commerce company.

@section 5.5 | Industrial Statistics and Relations

@q 4:18-20

The **Index of Industrial Production** covers **mining, manufacturing and electricity** (not construction); its base year is **2011-12** (earlier 2004-05 from June 2011). Industry is about **25-28% of GVA**; manufacturing about 17%.

